---
// Testimonials.astro - Clean, professional testimonials
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-white" id="testimonials">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-20">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Testimonials</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-6">
        What colleagues say
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
        Recommendations from professional teammates I've worked with on enterprise projects.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Grid -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20">
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div class="bg-neutral-50 rounded-lg p-8 border border-neutral-200">
        <blockquote class="text-neutral-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          "Jake takes ownership of complex features and delivers them ahead of
          schedule. His clean code and thorough testing make code reviews a
          breeze. A developer you can count on."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="flex items-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-900 rounded flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">RK</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ml-3">
            <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-900">Rachel Kim</div>
            <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Senior Software Engineer</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div class="bg-neutral-50 rounded-lg p-8 border border-neutral-200">
        <blockquote class="text-neutral-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          "What impressed me most was Jake's ability to translate vague
          requirements into solid technical solutions. He asks the right
          questions and builds exactly what's needed."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="flex items-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-900 rounded flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">DM</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ml-3">
            <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-900">David Martinez</div>
            <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">Product Manager</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div class="bg-neutral-50 rounded-lg p-8 border border-neutral-200">
        <blockquote class="text-neutral-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          "Jake doesn't just write code—he thinks through the entire user
          experience. His applications are polished, performant, and actually
          solve real problems. Highly recommend."
        </blockquote>

        <div class="flex items-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-900 rounded flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">SL</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ml-3">
            <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-900">Sarah Lopez</div>
            <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm">UX Designer</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="border-t border-neutral-200 pt-16">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4">Ready to work together?</h3>
        <p class="text-xl text-neutral-600 mb-8">
          I bring the same professionalism and quality from my enterprise work
          to every freelance project.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-neutral-900 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            Get in touch
          </a>
          <a
            href="#services"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border-2 border-neutral-300 text-neutral-900 font-medium rounded-lg hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            View services
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
